WEBVTT

00:12.561 --> 00:14.563
[opening theme song playing]

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

01:48.281 --> 01:49.449
[Toshiro] Mukuru.

01:49.533 --> 01:50.575
[Ivy] <i>Out of my way!</i>

01:50.659 --> 01:53.578
<i>That person made my sister</i>
<i>go through Transfloration.</i>

01:53.662 --> 01:55.038
<i>I won't stop until I get revenge!</i>

01:55.122 --> 01:59.126
<i>I'll kill her, and kill her, and kill her,</i>
<i>and tear her apart after I kill her.</i>

01:59.209 --> 02:00.752
<i>I'll rip her to pieces!</i>

02:00.836 --> 02:02.045
Please don't do that.

02:02.129 --> 02:03.255
Yomiko regrets it all.

02:03.964 --> 02:07.092
She's always wondered if she could have
helped Shiika Izumi.

02:07.175 --> 02:09.469
She's been trying to think of ways
she could get you to…

02:09.553 --> 02:10.804
to forgive her.

02:10.887 --> 02:12.472
She wants to atone for what she's done!

02:13.598 --> 02:14.599
[Ivy] <i>What does "atone" mean?</i>

02:17.477 --> 02:21.606
It means desperately apologizing
until you're able to forgive her.

02:22.732 --> 02:24.192
This has to work.

02:25.318 --> 02:26.987
<i>She wants to apologize?</i>

02:27.070 --> 02:29.739
<i>Then jump off this train</i>
<i>right now and die!</i>

02:30.574 --> 02:32.701
No! That won't fix anything!

02:32.784 --> 02:35.162
Getting revenge isn't… it isn't the way.

02:35.245 --> 02:36.246
It's not…

02:36.329 --> 02:39.916
<i>No matter how many times she apologizes,</i>
<i>it means nothing to me.</i>

02:40.000 --> 02:42.878
<i>I'll never ever forgive her</i>
<i>for being alive!</i>

02:45.589 --> 02:48.884
If you do kill Yomiko,
then I'm going to kill you.

02:49.759 --> 02:53.013
Forget what I said about
revenge not being the way.

02:53.096 --> 02:57.475
If Yomiko dies, I'm going to chase you
to the ends of the earth and kill you.

02:57.559 --> 02:59.394
<i>- Then--</i>
- She saved me.

02:59.477 --> 03:00.687
Yomiko saved me!

03:01.730 --> 03:02.898
I'm the same as you!

03:03.815 --> 03:05.108
Life is hard.

03:05.191 --> 03:08.987
Nothing good has ever happened to me
since the day I was born, okay?

03:09.070 --> 03:11.281
But then I met her
and now I owe her my life.

03:11.364 --> 03:12.532
[Yomiko whimpering]

03:12.616 --> 03:15.452
Even if she's a murderer,
I won't let her die!

03:15.535 --> 03:17.537
[sobbing]

03:19.080 --> 03:20.707
[Ivy] <i>Are you serious?</i>

03:20.790 --> 03:22.959
<i>You and I are not the same.</i>

03:23.043 --> 03:24.377
<i>You're wrong!</i>

03:24.878 --> 03:26.129
[Toshiro] Mukuru.

03:26.212 --> 03:31.968
I saw it, the kind of life that
you used to live, in Paupertown.

03:32.594 --> 03:34.179
<i>What does that mean?</i>

03:36.014 --> 03:38.308
<i>Don't act like you know me</i>
<i>just because of that!</i>

03:40.518 --> 03:42.020
I do know you.

03:42.103 --> 03:43.271
I do.

03:46.983 --> 03:49.653
In the same way that
Yomiko was able to save me,

03:49.736 --> 03:52.989
I want you to be saved too.

03:53.073 --> 03:54.574
[gentle music playing]

04:15.804 --> 04:16.888
[gasps]

04:18.807 --> 04:21.101
Mukuru, I found another candy wrapper.

04:21.726 --> 04:23.520
This one's really pretty, right?

04:23.603 --> 04:26.690
Shiika, be serious and keep searching.

04:26.773 --> 04:28.566
The only way that we can make money

04:28.650 --> 04:32.112
is if it's something that's hard,
like doorknobs and wires and stuff.

04:32.654 --> 04:36.324
[Toshiro] <i>These are Ivy's memories,</i>
<i>Mukuru Izumi's memories.</i>

04:37.575 --> 04:39.744
<i>Am I able to read memories now too?</i>

04:44.416 --> 04:45.625
[Shiika] Mukuru!

04:47.627 --> 04:48.670
Look.

04:48.753 --> 04:51.506
Whoa! You found one
with candy still inside?

04:51.589 --> 04:53.216
[Shiika] I made a ball out of snow.

04:54.092 --> 04:55.302
That's all it is?

04:58.305 --> 04:59.597
Mmm!

05:01.266 --> 05:03.560
Wow, I feel like this
really does taste sweet.

05:04.227 --> 05:05.437
[chuckling]

05:10.025 --> 05:11.693
HOSPITAL

05:11.776 --> 05:13.320
[doctor] She has a cold.

05:14.237 --> 05:17.282
She's also suffering from
mild malnutrition and diarrhea.

05:17.365 --> 05:20.702
If she's infected by another virus
or bacteria now, it'll be bad.

05:20.785 --> 05:22.203
- So be careful.
- [Shiika breathing shakily]

05:22.287 --> 05:25.081
[Mukuru] A virus or bacterial infection?

05:25.165 --> 05:26.791
Okay, but, Doctor, uh…

05:27.625 --> 05:29.794
about the money that I need for this…

05:31.796 --> 05:33.006
[doctor sighs softly]

05:34.215 --> 05:35.842
[doctor] I won't charge you this time.

05:36.593 --> 05:39.596
<i>This is three days' worth</i>
<i>of fever reducers and antibiotics.</i>

05:46.394 --> 05:47.771
[Mukuru] Shiika.

05:48.396 --> 05:50.774
I'm so sorry for always making you suffer.

05:55.111 --> 05:55.945
MUKURU & SHIIKA IZUMI

05:56.029 --> 05:56.905
I'm home.

05:56.988 --> 05:58.656
- [gasps]
- You're sick!

05:58.740 --> 05:59.741
What are you doing?

05:59.824 --> 06:01.367
You need to stay in bed!

06:01.451 --> 06:03.495
- [giggles]
- Jeez.

06:03.578 --> 06:05.830
You're really making candy
with snow again?

06:05.914 --> 06:06.873
[Shiika] Yeah, come look!

06:06.956 --> 06:09.000
I made a whole bag of them!

06:09.667 --> 06:11.795
Whoa! They look like the real thing!

06:11.878 --> 06:13.546
[Shiika giggling]

06:15.006 --> 06:16.549
Did you find that book today?

06:16.633 --> 06:18.676
[Mukuru] Yeah, I found it
while I was collecting scrap metal.

06:19.511 --> 06:22.138
[Toshiro]
<i>"Introduction to Architectural Design."</i>

06:23.223 --> 06:24.307
Can you read it?

06:25.433 --> 06:26.684
[Mukuru] Yeah, I can.

06:26.768 --> 06:27.769
I think…

06:27.852 --> 06:29.270
[Shiika] It's not too hard?

06:36.903 --> 06:37.737
STRUCTURE

06:37.821 --> 06:39.864
[Mukuru] I keep seeing this word,
but I don't know what it is.

06:39.948 --> 06:40.782
STRUCTURE

06:41.407 --> 06:42.784
Maybe it's someone's name.

06:46.121 --> 06:48.289
SIMILAR TO THE LETTER K

06:49.833 --> 06:51.000
It's everywhere.

06:52.502 --> 06:53.753
[Shiika coughing]

06:53.837 --> 06:55.755
[Mukuru] Are you okay?

06:55.839 --> 06:57.507
[Shiika breathing shakily]

07:06.432 --> 07:07.600
[panting]

07:13.565 --> 07:14.566
[grunts]

07:15.150 --> 07:16.568
[raspy breathing]

07:17.402 --> 07:18.987
[Toshiro] <i>Something's wrong with him.</i>

07:19.070 --> 07:20.238
<i>It's not just exhaustion.</i>

07:20.321 --> 07:22.490
- [Shiika wheezing]
<i>- It's lack of oxygen.</i>

07:22.574 --> 07:26.453
<i>I didn't even notice, but there's</i>
<i>not a single Spiriflora around here.</i>

07:26.536 --> 07:28.830
[strained breathing]

07:33.835 --> 07:34.836
[man] Hey!

07:36.004 --> 07:37.172
Are you all right?

07:41.176 --> 07:42.343
[pensive music playing]

07:47.140 --> 07:48.808
It's hypoxic encephalopathy.

07:49.684 --> 07:50.768
W-what?

07:50.852 --> 07:52.312
I don't know what that means.

07:53.104 --> 07:54.939
My body doesn't do what I want it to.

07:55.023 --> 07:56.107
[doctor] It's just like I said.

07:56.900 --> 07:59.736
As a result of your brain being
deprived of oxygen for a long time,

08:00.778 --> 08:03.490
your brain has been damaged
and there's paralysis in your limbs.

08:03.573 --> 08:05.033
Look kid, whenever you're out there,

08:05.116 --> 08:07.452
you have to make sure
you bring an oxygen mask with you.

08:07.535 --> 08:08.953
How do you not know that?

08:10.955 --> 08:12.707
What is that… oxygen?

08:14.584 --> 08:15.627
What is it?

08:15.710 --> 08:16.753
Is it air?

08:17.837 --> 08:19.756
But there is air out there, right?

08:20.423 --> 08:21.549
[doctor] Oxygen is--

08:21.633 --> 08:23.134
[Mukuru] You keep using big words.

08:23.843 --> 08:25.595
What does "brain damage" mean?

08:26.387 --> 08:28.806
How come my body doesn't do
what I want it to?

08:28.890 --> 08:30.225
When will it get better?

08:32.060 --> 08:34.979
With current technology,
it won't get better.

08:35.522 --> 08:36.606
[Mukuru] Why not?

08:36.689 --> 08:40.109
All you have to do is get rid
of something called a virus, right?

08:40.193 --> 08:41.611
- [Mukuru groans]
- [doctor] Watch out!

08:43.029 --> 08:44.781
[Mukuru] Hurry up and fix me.

08:44.864 --> 08:47.325
I need to be back to normal.
[gasps for air]

08:48.952 --> 08:50.787
My sister, Shiika, needs me!

08:50.870 --> 08:53.206
I have to be able to make money for her!

08:53.289 --> 08:55.291
I understand that this is a shock.

08:55.375 --> 08:57.001
But I cannot heal you.

08:57.502 --> 08:59.754
Part of your brain is not functioning.

09:00.547 --> 09:01.923
Even if there's air,

09:02.006 --> 09:05.718
humans can't breathe without
the small particles called oxygen.

09:07.887 --> 09:09.847
You didn't have that knowledge.

09:10.682 --> 09:11.724
[Mukuru sobbing]

09:14.018 --> 09:15.937
Knowledge and imagination.

09:17.188 --> 09:20.817
Knowledge and imagination
keep misfortune away.

09:22.235 --> 09:23.653
They enrich your life.

09:25.947 --> 09:29.033
[Mukuru] Knowledge and imagination.

09:29.117 --> 09:33.288
But how did everyone else
get to have those things?

09:33.371 --> 09:35.456
Did they have them before they were born?

09:39.586 --> 09:42.672
- Shiika, you need to eat something.
- [Shiika whimpering]

09:42.755 --> 09:43.590
I don't feel good.

09:43.673 --> 09:46.301
[Mukuru] You won't get better
unless you eat. [grunts]

09:46.384 --> 09:47.844
[coughing]

09:49.137 --> 09:51.347
[wheezing]

10:01.608 --> 10:04.360
[Mukuru] When you feel better,
let's go buy some candy.

10:05.695 --> 10:06.571
[Shiika] Huh?

10:07.363 --> 10:08.948
As your reward.

10:10.074 --> 10:11.993
So try to eat something, okay?

10:14.746 --> 10:18.916
[Shiika, voice trembling]
I hope we buy… something pretty.

10:21.336 --> 10:25.673
I wonder what it's… gonna taste like.

10:26.966 --> 10:27.967
[door opens]

10:28.051 --> 10:28.885
[gasps]

10:30.386 --> 10:32.597
Who… who are you?

10:32.680 --> 10:34.098
[grunting]

10:34.641 --> 10:35.892
Shiika!

10:35.975 --> 10:37.018
Shiika!

10:37.644 --> 10:38.686
What are you doing?

10:38.770 --> 10:40.063
Let me go!

10:40.146 --> 10:41.606
[man 1] Behave yourself!

10:41.689 --> 10:43.358
[Mukuru grunting] Let go!

10:44.942 --> 10:45.943
[groaning]

10:51.407 --> 10:53.576
[man 1 cries out] You little brat!

10:55.119 --> 10:56.037
[Mukuru grunts]

10:56.120 --> 10:57.413
[man 2] Leave him!

10:57.497 --> 10:59.290
We can't sell the boy for much anyway.

10:59.374 --> 11:00.375
[Mukuru mutters]

11:00.750 --> 11:02.168
Shiika… [grunts]

11:05.129 --> 11:06.047
[whimpering]

11:06.130 --> 11:07.048
[Mukuru] Stop!

11:07.548 --> 11:08.883
Don't take her away!

11:09.717 --> 11:10.635
Shiika!

11:10.718 --> 11:12.095
Run!

11:12.178 --> 11:13.471
Fight back and run!

11:14.764 --> 11:15.765
[whimpering]

11:19.310 --> 11:20.478
[Shiika breathing shakily]

11:21.229 --> 11:22.230
[gasping]

11:26.484 --> 11:27.402
[Shiika gasping]

11:28.986 --> 11:29.987
Muku--

11:30.071 --> 11:31.114
[door slams shut]

11:31.197 --> 11:32.573
[melancholy music playing]

11:55.972 --> 11:57.014
[door opens]

11:57.473 --> 11:58.474
[door shuts]

11:59.100 --> 12:00.435
[footsteps approaching]

12:02.353 --> 12:03.896
[man] Oh, hello there.

12:04.981 --> 12:07.525
[Toshiro] <i>This guy must be Dr. Kudai.</i>

12:07.608 --> 12:09.360
I know that this is sudden,

12:09.444 --> 12:12.780
but I'd like to perform an experiment
on you, if you will let me.

12:12.864 --> 12:14.449
When I've tried it on mice,

12:14.532 --> 12:18.202
the energy of the soul,
or rather, of life, is quite limited.

12:18.911 --> 12:21.289
I was hoping to now try it out on humans.

12:22.039 --> 12:25.376
Basically, you'd be undergoing surgery
to become a plant,

12:25.460 --> 12:26.919
but what's special about it

12:27.003 --> 12:29.839
is that it will make it possible
for you to move again.

12:29.922 --> 12:32.758
And if there's anything else
I can do for you, I will.

12:35.261 --> 12:36.345
What do you think?

12:39.599 --> 12:40.641
[Mukuru gasps]

12:42.810 --> 12:43.769
[sighs softly]

12:46.772 --> 12:48.316
My sister, Shiika.

12:49.734 --> 12:51.611
Do you think you can find her for me?

12:52.612 --> 12:53.696
[Dr. Kudai] Of course I can!

12:53.779 --> 12:55.490
It'll be easy as pie!

12:55.573 --> 12:56.491
Thank you!

12:56.574 --> 12:59.160
I look forward to our work together,
subject number five!

12:59.243 --> 13:01.412
SHIIKA

13:03.456 --> 13:04.290
[Mukuru] I don't get it.

13:05.416 --> 13:09.128
[Dr. Kudai] After doing a bit of research,
I can confirm this is your sister.

13:10.296 --> 13:11.380
[Mukuru] Oh.

13:11.756 --> 13:13.090
[sobbing]

13:13.382 --> 13:14.425
Oh…

13:14.509 --> 13:15.635
[continues sobbing]

13:19.680 --> 13:20.806
[screaming]

13:30.066 --> 13:31.234
[Ivy] <i>Why are you suddenly crying?</i>

13:32.860 --> 13:33.945
[Toshiro] Just now…

13:34.487 --> 13:37.448
your memories and your sadness
from when you lived in Paupertown…

13:38.908 --> 13:40.117
they flowed into me.

13:40.660 --> 13:41.536
<i>What do you mean?</i>

13:41.619 --> 13:42.870
[voice breaking] I saw it all.

13:43.538 --> 13:46.916
When Shiika was taken away
and then harvested.

13:47.625 --> 13:48.626
I saw your despair.

13:48.709 --> 13:50.294
<i>There's no way! You're lying!</i>

13:50.378 --> 13:52.338
No, I'm not! Believe me!

13:52.421 --> 13:56.217
<i>If you're going to insult me and Shiika,</i>
<i>I won't forgive you, either.</i>

13:57.468 --> 13:58.469
You…

13:58.928 --> 13:59.804
[sobs softly]

14:01.347 --> 14:03.224
You shouldn't eat snow.

14:04.100 --> 14:04.934
<i>What?</i>

14:06.102 --> 14:07.853
All of the snow in Paupertown,

14:08.396 --> 14:12.149
it contains bacteria and trash
from 100 years ago. It's poison.

14:12.942 --> 14:14.569
<i>How do you know about the snow?</i>

14:15.319 --> 14:16.362
<i>Wait, what?</i>

14:16.445 --> 14:17.989
<i>The snow's poison?</i>

14:18.072 --> 14:20.366
So Shiika was eating poison
the whole time?

14:20.449 --> 14:21.409
I'm sorry.

14:21.492 --> 14:23.661
I shouldn't have told you about the snow.

14:23.744 --> 14:25.037
I just wanted you to trust me.

14:25.121 --> 14:27.164
<i>I never stopped her from eating it.</i>

14:27.957 --> 14:29.792
<i>I didn't know that it was bad.</i>

14:30.585 --> 14:31.586
<i>It's my fault.</i>

14:31.669 --> 14:33.379
Don't blame yourself for it!

14:33.462 --> 14:34.755
It wasn't your fault.

14:34.839 --> 14:36.299
You had no idea!

14:37.216 --> 14:39.844
Everyone is born not knowing anything.

14:39.927 --> 14:41.512
We're all like a blank slate.

14:41.596 --> 14:43.514
The reason that
we're all able to learn things

14:43.598 --> 14:45.474
is because other people teach us.

14:46.809 --> 14:49.854
You just never had anyone
to teach you, Mukuru.

14:52.231 --> 14:55.735
So now, all of that pain,
that frustration, and that anger…

14:57.445 --> 14:58.446
we can share it.

14:59.363 --> 15:00.197
[Ivy sobbing]

15:05.453 --> 15:10.333
<i>Mister… do you think that</i>
<i>I can find happiness now?</i>

15:13.377 --> 15:14.795
[Toshiro] No, you can't.

15:15.504 --> 15:17.131
You killed a lot of people.

15:17.673 --> 15:19.550
You have to face
the consequences for that.

15:19.634 --> 15:22.094
<i>Mister, what is that?</i>

15:22.178 --> 15:24.472
<i>Stop it. You're making me really scared.</i>

15:24.555 --> 15:26.933
- Ivy…
- Please, don't do anything.

15:27.934 --> 15:30.853
<i>Please, just… just be my friend.</i>

15:31.812 --> 15:34.023
[grimacing]

15:37.234 --> 15:39.987
I don't know if you can hear me,
but I need to say this.

15:40.696 --> 15:41.989
The truth is… [sniffling]

15:42.281 --> 15:45.743
I had your sister undergo Transfloration
to protect myself.

15:47.161 --> 15:48.037
[sniffling]

15:48.120 --> 15:49.455
I'm sorry for that.

15:50.039 --> 15:51.332
[Ivy] <i>I can't forgive you.</i>

15:52.667 --> 15:54.293
I'm sorry it's unfair.

15:55.711 --> 15:57.296
You're holding a bomb, right?

15:57.380 --> 16:00.216
Once you light it, we need to run
to the back of the car quickly.

16:01.467 --> 16:02.969
We cannot forgive him.

16:05.972 --> 16:07.348
[male voice] <i>I'll kill you.</i>

16:07.431 --> 16:08.849
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

16:08.933 --> 16:11.102
Hikasa's going to do it, kill Dr. Kudai.

16:11.185 --> 16:12.561
[Ivy gasping]

16:23.030 --> 16:24.115
[Toshiro gasps]

16:24.782 --> 16:26.367
Oh, that's not good, that's not good!

16:26.450 --> 16:29.161
Run! Run, run! [screaming]

16:29.787 --> 16:30.788
[Toshiro grunts]

16:32.707 --> 16:33.666
[Yomiko] Oh, let's go.

16:34.750 --> 16:36.961
We need to stop Hikasa
and capture Dr. Kudai.

16:38.713 --> 16:40.631
- [footsteps approaching]
- [breathing shakily]

16:49.223 --> 16:50.975
Do you have any idea how many times

16:51.058 --> 16:54.353
I've tried to help you and your child
get back on track?

16:54.437 --> 16:57.523
But you haven't changed.
You're still abusive to your child.

16:58.858 --> 17:02.778
There's no point in a person like you,
someone without love, being alive.

17:04.989 --> 17:07.033
You have to shine.

17:07.116 --> 17:08.826
Please, shine on everyone.

17:10.578 --> 17:12.038
With love and…

17:13.122 --> 17:15.499
with… light.

17:20.337 --> 17:21.547
Who are you?

17:23.049 --> 17:26.761
Did the two of you come all this way
to kill me, just like he did?

17:27.470 --> 17:29.221
You're Dr. Kudai.

17:34.602 --> 17:36.687
We're employees at Transflora Medical.

17:37.104 --> 17:39.648
We want you to appear in court
with the research materials

17:39.732 --> 17:41.525
and cultivation records regarding Ivy,

17:41.609 --> 17:43.069
or Mukuru Izumi,

17:43.152 --> 17:45.780
the person who's undergone
Late Stage Transfloration.

17:46.447 --> 17:49.950
We also want you to bring proof that
the Glory Days Party was involved.

17:52.286 --> 17:53.788
I won't be doing that.

17:54.580 --> 17:55.873
[blowing raspberry]

17:55.956 --> 17:57.291
[Yomiko gasps]

17:57.792 --> 18:00.044
There's nobody to back you up anymore.

18:00.127 --> 18:02.296
As long as you testify,
even if you're arrested,

18:02.379 --> 18:06.217
Transflora Medical will support you
so you can continue your research.

18:06.300 --> 18:08.135
- No, thanks.
- [Yomiko grunts]

18:08.219 --> 18:09.678
You have to do this!

18:09.762 --> 18:12.765
Tell everyone
Transflora Medical isn't involved!

18:12.848 --> 18:15.059
You really don't understand
a thing, do you?

18:15.142 --> 18:17.061
I'll do what I must to protect myself.

18:17.144 --> 18:18.145
[claps twice]

18:23.692 --> 18:25.194
Mukuru, what's wrong?

18:26.195 --> 18:27.488
Are you okay?

18:29.448 --> 18:31.075
- [explosion booms]
- [Yomiko and Toshiro scream]

18:33.911 --> 18:35.162
[breathing shakily]

18:44.547 --> 18:45.381
[gasps]

18:51.470 --> 18:52.680
[gasping]

19:02.064 --> 19:04.775
[Toshiro] <i>I can feel his excitement</i>
<i>and intent before he shoots.</i>

19:05.651 --> 19:06.986
<i>If I can read his timing…</i>

19:07.778 --> 19:09.238
[gunshots]

19:09.321 --> 19:10.239
<i>I can dodge it!</i>

19:10.322 --> 19:11.323
[gunshots continue]

19:11.407 --> 19:12.658
[bullet casings clatter]

19:16.745 --> 19:17.788
[electricity crackling]

19:20.499 --> 19:21.500
[Toshiro] <i>Right.</i>

19:21.667 --> 19:22.501
<i>Left.</i>

19:22.585 --> 19:23.961
<i>Above.</i>

19:24.420 --> 19:25.379
<i>Right.</i>

19:25.880 --> 19:27.006
<i>- Below.</i>
<i>- </i>[sword clangs]

19:27.464 --> 19:28.841
<i>- Left.</i>
- [sword clangs]

19:29.425 --> 19:30.301
<i>Strike.</i>

19:30.384 --> 19:31.635
[gas hissing]

19:34.471 --> 19:35.514
[Toshiro grunts]

19:36.682 --> 19:38.142
[gunshots]

19:42.813 --> 19:44.648
[gunshots continue]

19:45.733 --> 19:47.067
[somber music playing]

19:48.652 --> 19:50.404
Toshiro!

19:50.487 --> 19:51.906
- [sword clanging]
- [blood squelching]

19:52.948 --> 19:53.908
[Yomiko gasps]

19:55.951 --> 19:56.952
[clanging]

20:01.624 --> 20:02.666
[gasps]

20:06.212 --> 20:07.546
[Ivy] <i>Mister…</i>

20:07.630 --> 20:08.672
[gasps]

20:09.924 --> 20:11.467
[gasping, grunting]

20:11.550 --> 20:12.551
[coughing]

20:13.302 --> 20:14.678
[groaning]

20:16.430 --> 20:17.431
[gasps]

20:22.811 --> 20:24.521
[male voice] Thanks for leading me here.

20:28.567 --> 20:29.693
[gasps]

20:32.947 --> 20:33.989
[inhales sharply]

20:34.782 --> 20:36.325
- [dramatic music playing]
- [grunts]

20:48.379 --> 20:50.089
Toshiro! Toshiro!

20:50.172 --> 20:51.257
Toshiro!

20:51.632 --> 20:53.342
Hey! Hey!

20:53.425 --> 20:54.677
Please, don't die!

20:54.760 --> 20:56.220
Get up, Toshiro!

20:56.303 --> 20:57.471
Damn irregularity!

20:58.055 --> 20:58.973
[Yomiko sobbing] No!

20:59.056 --> 21:01.642
- [evil laughter]
- Hey, Toshiro!

21:02.643 --> 21:04.812
Please, you have to wake up!

21:04.895 --> 21:05.896
You…

21:06.939 --> 21:08.732
[Dr. Kudai] Do these roots belong to him?

21:11.193 --> 21:13.445
It would be such a waste
to let him die in vain.

21:13.529 --> 21:15.698
Why don't you carry him over there?

21:16.699 --> 21:17.658
[gasps]

21:18.200 --> 21:19.410
What's the matter?

21:19.952 --> 21:22.788
If you're a Transflora Medical employee,
then help me.

21:28.168 --> 21:29.253
[Toshiro exhales]

21:32.881 --> 21:34.466
[peaceful music playing]

21:45.978 --> 21:47.104
[Toshiro] <i>I'm dead?</i>

21:47.187 --> 21:48.188
<i>I can't be!</i>

21:48.272 --> 21:49.940
<i>I wasn't ready for this yet.</i>

21:50.024 --> 21:52.693
<i>I didn't get to say goodbye</i>
<i>to Yomiko or to Mom.</i>

21:56.780 --> 21:58.657
What… What was that just now?

22:07.082 --> 22:08.584
[overlapping conversations]

22:08.667 --> 22:10.461
[grunting in pain]

22:10.544 --> 22:12.463
[overlapping conversations continue]

22:19.303 --> 22:22.973
[Toshiro] <i>There's so much information</i>
<i>going into my head.</i>

22:23.057 --> 22:24.308
[man] <i>Is he serious?</i>

22:24.391 --> 22:25.893
[woman] <i>She looks so beautiful.</i>

22:27.561 --> 22:28.562
[Toshiro] <i>This isn't…</i>

22:28.645 --> 22:30.731
- [overlapping conversations continue]
- …the afterlife.

22:31.315 --> 22:35.819
<i>It's a field of flowers where the memories</i>
<i>and emotions of all things are alive.</i>

22:35.903 --> 22:36.904
[Mukuru] Mister!

22:36.987 --> 22:38.447
[pensive music playing]

22:42.159 --> 22:43.202
Mister!

22:43.952 --> 22:46.038
- [gasps]
- Hey!

22:46.121 --> 22:47.664
This place is amazing!

22:48.082 --> 22:50.084
I can tell what every
single person in the world

22:50.167 --> 22:51.960
is thinking about and feeling!

22:52.961 --> 22:54.046
Mukuru?

22:54.129 --> 22:55.380
[laughing]

22:56.548 --> 22:58.967
My mind is starting to feel
all tingly right now!

22:59.051 --> 23:00.385
I think I want to make something!

23:01.261 --> 23:02.596
[bubbling]

23:02.679 --> 23:04.098
[laughing]

23:04.181 --> 23:05.349
[gasps softly]

23:05.432 --> 23:06.975
[continues laughing]

23:07.059 --> 23:08.435
[pensive music continues]

23:10.562 --> 23:12.481
[Toshiro] <i>Knowledge and imagination.</i>

23:13.941 --> 23:17.611
<i>Knowledge and imagination</i>
<i>keep misfortune away.</i>

23:20.948 --> 23:22.574
<i>They enrich your life.</i>

23:29.498 --> 23:30.582
[Mukuru] I'm sorry, Shiika.

23:30.666 --> 23:33.043
I'm sorry I'm the only one having fun!

23:34.837 --> 23:37.131
I'm glad that I… was born!

23:37.214 --> 23:38.799
[pensive music continues]

23:52.563 --> 23:54.565
[closing theme music playing]
